msgstr ""
"Zu den international gültigen Zertifikaten gehören NEBOSH (National "
"Examination Board in Occupational Safety and Health, England), IOSH "
"(Institution of Occupational Safety and Health, England) und OSHA "
"(Occupational Safety and Health Administration, USA) Schulungen und "
